<Layout
  title="Waterborne vs Oil-Based Polyurethane for Hardwood Floors | CalcForDIY"
  description="Compare waterborne vs oil-based polyurethane for hardwood floors. Cure time, Taber abrasion hardness, amber yellowing over time, and indoor VOC fumes."
>

  <script type="application/ld+json" is:inline>
